ms.\n[4.5s-6s] Hard cut, both explode forward again at each other, a fast whip pan between them.\n[6s-7.5s] Hard cut, the camera rushes forward between them straight into a blinding blood-red blast of fire that fills the entire frame and turns to black.\n\nHard cuts only, no dissolves, no slow motion, no freeze frames. No text, no letters, no logos, no subtitles, no UI.\n\nAudio: no music. Loud punchy combat sound design: a colossal explosion, flying debris, armor slamming onto stone, a roar of fire, both fighters' furious war cries, a final rushing fire whoosh into a deep boom.",
